//- Фільтр на :checked ~: радіокнопки (по одній на категорію) мають бути сусідами сітки
section#works.works.section(aria-labelledby='works-title')
  .container
    each filter, i in filters
      input.works__radio(
        type='radio',
        name='works-filter',
        id=`filter-${filter.id}`,
        value=filter.id,
        checked=i === 0
      )
    input#works-more.works__more(type='checkbox', aria-label='Show all works')
    .works__head
      h2#works-title.section-title Our awesome works
      .works__chips
        each filter in filters
          label.chip(for=`filter-${filter.id}`)= filter.label
    ul.works-grid
      each work, i in works
        li.works-grid__item(
          class={ 'works-grid__item--from-md': work.showFrom === 'md', 'works-grid__item--from-lg': work.showFrom === 'lg' },
          data-category=work.category
        )
          +work-card(work, i === 0)
    .works__footer
      label.btn.btn--secondary.works__load-more(for='works-more')
        span.works__label-more Load more works
        span.works__label-less Showing all works
